## Art & assets
- All textures, models, animated textures and machine GUIs follow the `mekstyle` skill (.claude/skills/mekstyle/).
- Blockbench is reachable through the `blockbench` MCP server (Blockbench desktop must be running with the MCP plugin).
- After touching anything in src/main/resources/assets/, run:
  `python .claude/skills/mekstyle/scripts/lint_textures.py src/main/resources/assets/<modid> --strict-palette`
